          "text": "How long have I been collecting vintage films?"
        },
        "degraded_reasons": [],
        "facts": [],
        "history": [],
        "raw": [
          {
            "enrichment": "failed",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I'm also curious about the best way to display my cameras. I recently organized my collection and have 17 cameras now, including the new Brownie Hawkeye I got last week. I've got them on a shelf, but I'm not sure if that's the best way to show them off."
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-23",
            "sequence": 2,
            "source_id": "80856-1791154783857300000-73"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "failed",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I'm also curious about the best way to store and display my Funko POP! figures. I've got a large collection of them, including the entire set of Marvel Cinematic Universe figures, and I want to make sure they're displayed in a way that showcases them nicely."
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-23",
            "sequence": 4,
            "source_id": "80856-1791155135430941000-180"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "coverage_gaps",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I've also been thinking about displaying my posters and art prints. I recently got a new poster from Mondo featuring an illustration of the Hogwarts castle from Harry Potter, and I want to make sure it's displayed nicely. Do you have any advice on how to store and display my posters and art prints in a way that showcases them nicely?"
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-23",
            "sequence": 6,
            "source_id": "80856-1791155527036863000-299"
          }
